      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This might be cool.\n\nIf it also allows Udon to see the name of the group, it could however have the consequence of making it possible to blacklist specific groups from making group instances of a world. This would technically not be in violation of the current [Udon Moderation Tool Guidelines](https://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/udon/udon-moderation-tool-guidelines/), since it wouldn't be blacklisting specific players but just groups.\n\nFor example, if a world creator doesn't like a specific group making group instances of their world, they can write an udon script that breaks the world when it detects a specific group is the instance owner.\n\nI might just be worried for no reason though.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-06-13T15:42:02.830Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Since we have Group, Group+ and Group Public instance, how about we add :\n\nAn Udon function that allows to display Group's icon or banner of the Group that screated a Group instance.\n\nThis would allow world makers to display the icon or banner of the group that created the instance in selected places.\n\nIt allows for branding instances even more with groups.\n\nWorld creators can create spaces for the group to be promoted on, with or without collaboration with any specific groups.\n\nIt the world creator does not want this function, they do not have to use it.",
